+
+  /// Ada fixed-point scale, recorded by DWARFASTParserClang on a unique
+  /// per-base-type Clang typedef so AdaLanguage's data formatter can render
+  /// the real (scaled) value (raw * 2^binary_scale or raw * 10^decimal_scale).
